- Round probabilities to two decimal places (e.g., 0.75).

DEFINITIONS (how to judge from text):
- do_call: probability the agent will actually execute the required tool call (1.0 = explicit statement "I called X" or "done"; 0.0 = no sign of intent or explicit refusal). Use language cues:
