- params_match: given only the text, how closely would the call's parameters match the EXPECTED parameters if the call happens. 1.0 = the agent text includes exact recipient, subject, and body phrasing; 0.0 = none of the required parameters appear in text.
- intent_strength: how strongly the language commits to the specific action (explicit command vs suggestion vs no mention). Use values 0.0–1.0.

